A||N||7||Rob S||2002 FOCOA Fieo National Show||||1||
Z||000000||Rob S||11-09-2001||01:40 AM||||It's not too early to plan for next year's FOCOA National show. It will be<BR>hosted by Midwest Fieros of Onawa, Iowa, Heartland Fieros of Eastern Iowa,<BR>Gateway Fieros Of  St. Louis and the Kansas City Owners Group. The show will<BR>be located In The Heart of the Ozarks, Osage Beach, Missouri. The dates are<BR>August 1,2,3 & 4th 2002. I've started an informational page: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/midwestfieros/2002.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/midwestfieros/2002.html</A> <P>More information will be added later.<P>Rob Swanson<BR>Midwest Fieros<BR>Pierre SD<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||qwikgta||11-11-2001||07:49 PM||||Nice site, thanks for the info, I look forward to visiting it every now-and-then for updates.<P>Rob<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sig_Pic_copy.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrfiero||11-12-2001||01:14 AM||||All I can say is it's about time they had one close to Denver!  For once, I can make it to the show in one day!  It's usually a 24-36 hour drive for me, so this will be nice.<P>See you there!||||reg||6
Z||000003||WKDFIRO||11-13-2001||08:47 PM||||I understand that 2003 will be in Vegas!<P>Viva Las Vegas!||||reg||14
Z||000004||mrfiero||11-13-2001||08:53 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by WKDFIRO:<BR><B>I understand that 2003 will be in Vegas!<P>Viva Las Vegas!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Another close one!  It's only a 12 hour drive to Vegas from Denver!!  <P>I'm glad they are getting a few closer to me (out west), but I fear the quality of the shows (especially the Vegas one) will suffer.  <P>A select group of people (myself included) have no problem driving 1000-1500 miles to atend a shpw, but the majority of Fiero owners don't share this same belief.  <P>It will certainly attract more California and west coast Fiero people, but I'm not sure how many east coasters/midwesterners will make the trip. <P>I hope to see a bunch of you in Missouri and Vegas!||||reg||1
Z||000005||Tabs31||11-13-2001||08:55 PM||||Nice little site.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tabs31_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Old Lar||11-13-2001||09:02 PM||||I'm looking forward to the LasVegas trip.  I figure that it is a 4 day drive for me, one way.  No 15 hour days behind the wheel for this old guy.  Fran Passuite wants to go also, but Kay wouldn't make that trip in his Fiero. (I'm trying to talk him into a carpool in his Indy Pace car).  With two of us driving out, it may be a bearable trip.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Rob S||11-14-2001||01:56 AM||||I made my reservations today,(1-800-348-473l ask for the Fiero show rate of $69, a savings of 50 bucks over the regular rate)the resort has 153 rooms and we're hoping to use all of them for the show. There are four clubs hosting the event, each will be in charge of a different portion of the show. <P>Rob Swanson<BR>Midwest Fieros <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/midwestfieros/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/midwestfieros/</A> ||||reg||1
